        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_set_pool",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod_set_pool\n\nAdd lod_pool_test.ko, exercising lod_set_pool(): setting a pool name\nfrom NULL, replacing an existing one, the @*pool == @new_pool\nshort-circuit used by lod_obj_set_pool() when nothing changed, and\nclearing a pool back to NULL. It is a small, self-contained string\nhelper with no dt_object/OST/thandle involved, used here as a worked\nexample of mapping a kunit module to a single function via\nKUNIT.list's new \"<glob>:<function>\" syntax, rather than the\nwhole-directory \"*.[ch]\" glob the other lod kunit modules use.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5\nChange-Id: I9051e3a88b92cc10c2a6c4e6420c6032abc4906b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
